      "customData": {
        "section": "3-recompute",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          3820,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "The simplest loop appends the new token and runs the whole sequence again: step t pushes 870 + t − 1 tokens\nthrough all 24 layers, so every token costs as much as the first and each step grows with the conversation.\nStep 2 repeats step 1's 870 tokens at the same positions through the same weights. How many of them can\ngive a different result?",
      "originalText": "The simplest loop appends the new token and runs the whole sequence again: step t pushes 870 + t − 1 tokens\nthrough all 24 layers, so every token costs as much as the first and each step grows with the conversation.\nStep 2 repeats step 1's 870 tokens at the same positions through the same weights. How many of them can\ngive a different result?",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1W"
