      "customData": {
        "section": "6-code",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          7560,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Both versions share one loop: sample a token, time it, stop on a stop id or after 48 tokens. Only the step\ndiffers. The recomputing step rebuilds the whole sequence; the cached step sends one token at its own position,\nand each layer writes that token's keys and values into the cache, then reads every row so far.",
      "originalText": "Both versions share one loop: sample a token, time it, stop on a stop id or after 48 tokens. Only the step\ndiffers. The recomputing step rebuilds the whole sequence; the cached step sends one token at its own position,\nand each layer writes that token's keys and values into the cache, then reads every row so far.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b4c"
    },
