      "updated": 1794883829556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "8-production",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          10330,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "A production engine computes positions the same way: a step's queries start where the cache ends, so prefill\ncovers 0 to 869 and decode adds 870. Unlike ours, it scores only the last prefill row. DeepSeek reports 20 to 22\ntokens per second of average output for V3 and R1 on H800s over 24 hours, from a model with about 1,360 times\nour parameters serving many users at once. Ours, one request on the M1, gets 15.3.",
      "originalText": "A production engine computes positions the same way: a step's queries start where the cache ends, so prefill\ncovers 0 to 869 and decode adds 870. Unlike ours, it scores only the last prefill row. DeepSeek reports 20 to 22\ntokens per second of average output for V3 and R1 on H800s over 24 hours, from a model with about 1,360 times\nour parameters serving many users at once. Ours, one request on the M1, gets 15.3.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6l"
    },
